#: build-aux/i18n/br.com.biglinux.remoteplay.metainfo.xml.in:9
msgid ""
"Big Remote Play guides a host and guest through game streaming with Sunshine "
"and Moonlight. It also helps connect distant computers through an existing "
"VPN or a guided Tailscale, ZeroTier, or Headscale setup."
msgstr ""
"Big Remote Play 會引導分享端與連線端的電腦，透過 Sunshine 和 Moonlight 完成遊"
"戲串流。它也能透過現有的 VPN，或依步驟設定 Tailscale、ZeroTier 或 Headscale，"
"連接相隔遙遠的電腦。"

#: src/big_remote_play/ui/provider_page.py:123
